  "abstract": "{\"id\":\"qianchuan.subscribe_task_callback.set\",\"title\":\"随心推全域订单状态实时推送\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/subscribe_task_callback/set/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"capability_summary\":\"为订阅任务设置回调地址，用于随心推全域订单状态实时推送。关联接口：https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_promotion/list/\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"qianchuan.uni_promotion.list\",\"title\":\"\",\"path\":\"/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_promotion/list/\",\"relation\":\"关联接口\",\"reason\":\"文档中明确提及该关联接口\"}]}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-IRk6oUeI\" id=\"h346b9f0-IRk6oUeI\">回调地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ic9NODW3\">订阅任务设置回调地址</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-e34gBPrC\" id=\"h346b9f0-e34gBPrC\">关联API接口</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-R1mmBc3X\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/uni_promotion/list/</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-08WNmcSE\" id=\"h346b9f0-08WNmcSE\">请求方式</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-GBkTA6F0\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-o1AURLIa\" id=\"h346b9f0-o1AURLIa\">请求Header</h1><section class=\"table spi-table\" data-type=\"spitable\" data-tabletype=\"header\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求消息类型，允许值：application/json</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">X-Open-Signature</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">签名，用来验证此次请求的合法性，具体算法见<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1722481732805646\"> 【X-Open-Signature签名校验】</a></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-qNsCUYWj\" id=\"h346b9f0-qNsCUYWj\">请求参数</h1><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-DY6JVCBO\" id=\"h490b8bf-DY6JVCBO\">基础信息</h2><section class=\"table spi-table\" data-type=\"spitable\" data-tabletype=\"request\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">message_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">消息ID,唯一标识</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">subscribe_task_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">订阅任务ID</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">service_label</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">订阅服务类型<br>允许值: <code>status.aweme.uni_order.realtime</code><p data-id=\"p838747a-OfJRbC1d\"> 随心推全域订单状态实时推送推送</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">publish_time</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">消息实际产生时间，毫秒时间戳</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">timestamp</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">毫秒时间戳，本条消息实际推送时间，获取推送数据列表时无该参数数据</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">nonce</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">随机数，和timestamp组合防重放，获取推送数据列表时无该参数数据</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">app_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">应用id</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 6 8\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_relation</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">账号对应关系，包含所有的授权关系</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">core_user_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">用户授权账号</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 6 8\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">data</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">推送数据信息，订阅服务类型不同，返回结构不同 (该字段为序列化后的 json 字符串)</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">账户ID</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">账户类型 可选值: <br><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-dFRA8QNa\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Kj8EAShK\"><code>ADVERTISER</code> </li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">event</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">事件类型 可选值: <br><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-IjllK9LJ\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6PKG96kc\"><code>AUDIT</code> 审核中</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-f1n3Z1oG\"><code>BOOK</code> 未开播</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-VTHRHWW4\"><code>CREATING</code> 已支付</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-bzoq9tQO\"><code>DELIVERY_OK</code> 投放中</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-UmEL8169\"><code>FAILED</code> 计划创建失败</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-U6QR1gGn\"><code>FINISHED</code> 投放完成</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-qi0JS8o6\"><code>FROZEN</code> 投放终止</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-s4gjtlVI\"><code>OFFLINE_AUDIT</code> 审核不通过</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-NCUvaIaS\"><code>OVER</code> 投放结束</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-hQLlkmsT\"><code>TIMEOUT</code> 未支付超过15分钟，订单关闭</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PVH6trXg\"><code>UNPAID</code> 未支付</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-X9aK0Zq7\"><code>UNPAIDCANCEL</code> 未支付取消订单</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 20px;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 6 8\" fill=\"none\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">content</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">推送数据信息，订阅服务类型不同，返回结构不同</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">order_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">随心推订单id</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">ad_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\">随心推计划id</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">marketing_goal</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">营销目标 可选值: <br><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-IIPEeVBn\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-XxffLVNA\"><code>LIVE_PROM_GOODS</code> 直播全域</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-AYRrWpWM\"><code>VIDEO_PROM_GOODS</code>&nbsp;商品全域</li></ul></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-UjuG01M8\" id=\"h346b9f0-UjuG01M8\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22disabled%22%3Atrue%2C%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22message_id%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxxxxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22subscribe_task_id%5C%22%3A%20123456%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22service_label%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxxxxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22publish_time%5C%22%3A%20123456%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22timestamp%5C%22%3A%20123456%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22nonce%5C%22%3A%20123456%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22app_id%5C%22%3A%20123456%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22account_relation%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22core_user_ids%5C%22%3A%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20123456543%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22data%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22account_id%5C%22%3A%20123456%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22account_type%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxxxxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22event%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22xxxxxx%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22content%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22order_id%5C%22%3A%20123456%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22ad_id%5C%22%3A%20123456%2C%5C